        {
          "id": 1952077,
          "username": "websensepro",
          "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/websensepro/{size}/132469_2.png",
          "created_at": "2026-11-27T13:14:04.986Z",
          "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/socialautopost\">@SocialAutoPost</a> ,</p>\n<p>The trickiest edge case here happens when stores run an automatic discount instead of a manual promo code. Unlike discount codes, native Shopify automatic discounts do not let you exclude a wholesale customer segment, so a sitewide automatic offer can silently apply straight on top of wholesale catalog pricing when those buyers log in.</p>\n<p>If you run wholesale discounts through an app on Basic, Grow, or Advanced plans, check the Combinations checkboxes on both your wholesale rules and your Cyber Monday promotions so two product or order discounts never stack at checkout. Also test whether your retail free shipping threshold applies to wholesale carts too, since heavy bulk cartons qualifying for free parcel shipping will erase thin wholesale margins even faster than a stacked promo code.</p>\n<p>Thank you..</p>",
          "post_number": 2,
          "post_type": 1,
          "posts_count": 4,
          "updated_at": "2026-11-27T13:14:04.986Z",
          "reply_count": 0,
