        {
          "id": 1952249,
          "username": "dolia_goprofit",
          "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/dolia_goprofit/{size}/384674_2.png",
          "created_at": "2026-11-27T18:49:05.304Z",
          "cooked": "<p>Thanks for sharing these insights! Another thing worth considering is reviewing the actual profit margins after a few test orders, rather than just checking whether the discounts apply correctly. That should help merchants catch unexpected losses before the sale goes live.</p>",
          "post_number": 3,
          "post_type": 1,
