        {
          "id": 1952443,
          "username": "ChrisChu5",
          "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/chrischu5/{size}/351563_2.png",
          "created_at": "2026-11-28T06:11:59.314Z",
          "cooked": "<p>A lot of our clients who sell B2C and B2B have had to deal with blended sale pricing and the potential losses on them.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>B2B gets a fixed % price discount on the catalog.</li>\n<li>B2C promotion starts and sets new pricing</li>\n<li>B2B catalog users end up getting their wholesale price + an additional discount from the B2C sale, stacking a large discount than expected.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>So yes, this situation definitely happens quite often, and for catalogs beyond a handful of product, it can be really annoying to manually override each product by hand.</p>",
          "post_number": 4,
          "post_type": 1,
          "posts_count": 4,
          "updated_at": "2026-11-28T06:11:59.314Z",
          "reply_count": 0,
          "reply_to_post_number": null,
