  "comments": [
    {
      "author": "websensepro",
      "text": "Hi  @SocialAutoPost  , \n The trickiest edge case here happens when stores run an automatic discount instead of a manual promo code. Unlike discount codes, native Shopify automatic discounts do not let you exclude a wholesale customer segment, so a sitewide automatic offer can silently apply straight on top of wholesale catalog pricing when those buyers log in. \n If you run wholesale discounts through an app on Basic, Grow, or Advanced plans, check the Combinations checkboxes on both your wholesale rules and your Cyber Monday promotions so two product or order discounts never stack at checkout. Also test whether your retail free shipping threshold applies to wholesale carts too, since heavy bulk cartons qualifying for free parcel shipping will erase thin wholesale margins even faster than a stacked promo code. \n Thank you..",
      "at": "2026-11-27T13:14:04.986Z",
      "url": "https://community.shopify.com/t/test-sale-codes-on-your-wholesale-prices/724092/2"
    },
    {
      "author": "dolia_goprofit",
      "text": "Thanks for sharing these insights! Another thing worth considering is reviewing the actual profit margins after a few test orders, rather than just checking whether the discounts apply correctly. That should help merchants catch unexpected losses before the sale goes live.",
      "at": "2026-11-27T18:49:05.304Z",
      "url": "https://community.shopify.com/t/test-sale-codes-on-your-wholesale-prices/724092/3"
    },
    {
      "author": "ChrisChu5",
      "text": "A lot of our clients who sell B2C and B2B have had to deal with blended sale pricing and the potential losses on them. \n \n B2B gets a fixed % price discount on the catalog. \n B2C promotion starts and sets new pricing \n B2B catalog users end up getting their wholesale price + an additional discount from the B2C sale, stacking a large discount than expected. \n \n So yes, this situation definitely happens quite often, and for catalogs beyond a handful of product, it can be really annoying to manually override each product by hand.",
      "at": "2026-11-28T06:11:59.314Z",
      "url": "https://community.shopify.com/t/test-sale-codes-on-your-wholesale-prices/724092/4"
    }
  ],
  "comments_complete": true
